    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Grow Your Pets!</h2>This is a fantasy world of chill retro vibes! Here's some key game mechanics:<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Pet Growing System</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/70b85dac81f378da0f8d2b7af83d2eb8.poster.avif?t=1701605976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/70b85dac81f378da0f8d2b7af83d2eb8.webm?t=1701605976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/70b85dac81f378da0f8d2b7af83d2eb8.mp4?t=1701605976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every Pet has 3 stages that affect his appearance. You start with the first stage, and every 25th level Pet will evolve.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Upgrade &amp; Feeding System</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/bc511bae1ef2a3e432d99cc396f55280.avif?t=1701605976\" /></span><br>Your Pets are alive, so you'll have to feed them! They can be hungry and sad or well-fed and happy.<br>There are 4 stats: strength, stamina, intelligence and luck.<br>You can equip some trinkets and visual modification items on your Pet.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Minigames</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/f6f94ec081e323f805a3447affa2e6de.avif?t=1701605976\" /></span><br>Fish with your pet - he'll love that!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Forest</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/422e0c0a5361294c42c54e44775c073a.avif?t=1701605976\" /></span><br>Get ready to visit the Forest! Who knows, what's waiting for you there..<br><br>And some other features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Crafting &amp; Inventory<br></li><li>Collectables &amp; Stats<br></li><li>Trading system<br></li><li>The primary storyline and daily quests<br></li><li>Day &amp; night cycle (and raining, of course!)<br></li><li>And much more!</li></ul><br><strong>We wish you to have a good time!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Grow Your Pets!</h2>This is a fantasy world of chill retro vibes! Here's some key game mechanics:<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Pet Growing System</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/70b85dac81f378da0f8d2b7af83d2eb8.poster.avif?t=1701605976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/70b85dac81f378da0f8d2b7af83d2eb8.webm?t=1701605976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/70b85dac81f378da0f8d2b7af83d2eb8.mp4?t=1701605976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every Pet has 3 stages that affect his appearance. You start with the first stage, and every 25th level Pet will evolve.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Upgrade &amp; Feeding System</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/bc511bae1ef2a3e432d99cc396f55280.avif?t=1701605976\" /></span><br>Your Pets are alive, so you'll have to feed them! They can be hungry and sad or well-fed and happy.<br>There are 4 stats: strength, stamina, intelligence and luck.<br>You can equip some trinkets and visual modification items on your Pet.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Minigames</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/f6f94ec081e323f805a3447affa2e6de.avif?t=1701605976\" /></span><br>Fish with your pet - he'll love that!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Forest</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253770/extras/422e0c0a5361294c42c54e44775c073a.avif?t=1701605976\" /></span><br>Get ready to visit the Forest! Who knows, what's waiting for you there..<br><br>And some other features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Crafting &amp; Inventory<br></li><li>Collectables &amp; Stats<br></li><li>Trading system<br></li><li>The primary storyline and daily quests<br></li><li>Day &amp; night cycle (and raining, of course!)<br></li><li>And much more!</li></ul><br><strong>We wish you to have a good time!</strong>",
    "short_description": "You found a mysterious egg. By deciding to open it, your life has changed forever. Now you are the Pet Grower. Everyone thinks that all these creatures are extinct. But you know that there is someone, who chose exactly you. Wander through the forest, fish for food, upgrade pets. This is your world!",
